<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><atom:link href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/rss/feed.rss" type="application/rss+xml" rel="self"/><title>Amazon News</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link><description>Amazon News RSS Feed</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 03:07:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Amazon News</title><url>https://assets.aboutamazon.com/f2/a4/a07ef04d49df8b93eb283512a0fc/amazon-news-newsletter-beige.png</url><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link></image><item><title>The race our nation can’t afford to lose, plus a new commitment from us and a fresh set of community investments</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-data-centers-built-together?utm_source=rss</link><description></description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 08:55:14 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-data-centers-built-together</guid><category>Company news</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/eb94cec/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F12%2F26%2F200746cc4971855f5828ce07fb38%2Famazondatacenteremployee-hero-amazonnews-ck92926.png"/></item><item><title>How Amazon is helping communities impacted by the Nepal flash floods</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/nepal-floods-amazon-disaster-relief?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon is working with aid organizations to help communities recover following flooding and landslides along the Nepal border.</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 08:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/nepal-floods-amazon-disaster-relief</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/3e97f90/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F46%2F9c%2Ff08677644479b0f1a54b464c57f3%2Famazon-disasterrelief-humanitariangoods-nepal-amazonnews-cdlt-2026aug28.png"/></item><item><title>Amazon in the community: Service, community, and commitment at HQ2</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-arlington-virginia-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the National Capital Region.</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 21:44:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-arlington-virginia-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/4923257/2147483647/strip/true/crop/812x812+204+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe9%2F22%2F1243d8e149e19d8b6b2c4b8066a1%2Faerial-view-of-met-park.jpg"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in New Jersey</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-new-jersey-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting the Garden State&apos;s economy while creating opportunities for New Jersey residents. </description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 15:29:41 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-new-jersey-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/53bc215/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F31%2F9c%2F6c433d2640a693bb62f5a5384128%2Fabout-amazon-hero-mercer-adobestock-541109610.jpg"/></item><item><title>What’s new on Prime Video in October 2026, including ‘Carrie,’ ‘The Terminal List,’ and NBA games</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-october-films-shows-sports-2026?utm_source=rss</link><description>Prime Video’s October lineup also features new originals like ‘Masterplan’ and ‘Apocalypse Z 2.’</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:15:32 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-october-films-shows-sports-2026</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/566be28/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F22%2F71%2F16ff35f94ac4baf62744d6be28d6%2Fprime-video-new-october-hero.jpeg"/></item><item><title>Amazon introduces a completely redesigned Kindle family</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-kindle-lineup-2026?utm_source=rss</link><description>The all-new Kindle, Kindle Paperwhite, and Kindle Colorsoft are thinner and lighter with a new display stack and seamless edge-to-edge color across the lineup.</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:50:13 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-kindle-lineup-2026</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/dd3e7ff/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F21%2Fb1%2Fce065b0b4cd9a58fdf5a2338d72b%2Fsmaller-kindle-edition-hero-ube-amazon-news-lt.gif"/></item><item><title>Amazon&apos;s water conservation and replenishment efforts around the world</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/amazon-water-conservation-replenishment-sustainability?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest updates on how we’re reducing our water footprint and investing in innovations to address water scarcity.</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:06:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/amazon-water-conservation-replenishment-sustainability</guid><category>Sustainability</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/d788dad/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2025x2025+788+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ffb%2F4c%2F228d200747bd80fcdcfd69ac0b26%2Fstandard-jpg-adobestock-277214915.jpg"/></item><item><title>Arnold Schwarzenegger is Santa in Prime Video&apos;s &apos;The Man with the Bag&apos; teaser trailer, coming this Christmas</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/the-man-with-the-bag-arnold-schwarzenegger-christmas-movie-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>Schwarzenegger stars alongside Alan Ritchson in this holiday heist movie premiering on Prime Video December 2.</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:00:29 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/the-man-with-the-bag-arnold-schwarzenegger-christmas-movie-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/c53ed4e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F39%2F9b%2F180966524b90896b6ecc5d63d085%2Fthemanwiththebag-primevideo-film-amazonnews-cdlt-09292026.png"/></item><item><title>Fire TV launches all-new, faster 4K stick and new remote design</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/fire-tv-stick-4k-new-remote?utm_source=rss</link><description>The new Fire TV Stick 4K gets customers to content fast, and the redesigned Fire TV Remote features more tactile controls.</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:00:17 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/fire-tv-stick-4k-new-remote</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/aee9829/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F7b%2Fc8%2F94101af5458c88f7ae53afbf52d4%2Ffire-tv-stick-4k-ftv-remote-hero-amazonnews-ck92916.jpg"/></item><item><title>Alexa+ is making Fire TV smarter, from your TV to your phone</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/alexa-plus-fire-tv-hub-mobile-app-updates?utm_source=rss</link><description>New software updates introduce smarter search that understands more complex questions, a dedicated Alexa+ hub, and an upgraded Fire TV mobile app.</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:00:15 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/alexa-plus-fire-tv-hub-mobile-app-updates</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/6434fef/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fba%2F07%2Fc50c84bb4212b9ae6f1473cb3b59%2Ffire-tv-alexa-hub-gif-2000x1125.gif"/></item></channel></rss>